link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}.langs{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto 0;font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted)}.langs a{color:var(--lapis)}</style>\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-ER9F5C2HC1\"></script>\n<script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments)}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-ER9F5C2HC1',{allow_google_signals:false,allow_ad_personalization_signals:false});</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/41.html\">Sura Fussilat</a> › Aya 51</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Fussilat 41:51</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِذَا أَنْعَمْنَا عَلَى الْإِنسَانِ أَعْرَضَ وَنَأَىٰ بِجَانِبِهِ وَإِذَا مَسَّهُ الشَّرُّ فَذُو دُعَاءٍ عَرِيضٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kuma idan Muka yi ni&#x27;ima ga mutum, sai ya bijire, kuma ya nĩsantar da gẽfensa, kuma idan sharri ya sãme shi, sai ya zama ma&#x27;abũcin addu&#x27;a mai fãɗi.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وحزب يتضرعون إليه في حال الضراء. ويتوبون إليه. فإذا كشفها عنهم: أعرضوا عنه<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/371</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s41a51\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/41-50.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (41:50)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/41-53.html\">Aya ta gaba (41:53)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" ar